{"seq":2,"slug":"sparse-dense-hybrid","title":"稀疏与稠密混合检索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/neural-retrieval/sparse-dense-hybrid","wordCount":1406,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"稀疏与稠密混合检索\">稀疏与稠密混合检索</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>混合检索（Hybrid Retrieval）将稀疏检索（BM25、SPLADE）与稠密检索（Dense Retrieval）的结果进行融合，利用两种检索范式的互补优势来提升整体检索质量。稀疏检索擅长精确的词汇匹配，稠密检索擅长语义理解，两者融合能够覆盖更广泛的相关文档。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    Q[用户查询] --&gt; SP[稀疏检索器]&#10;    Q --&gt; DN[稠密检索器]&#10;    SP --&gt; R1[稀疏候选集]&#10;    DN --&gt; R2[稠密候选集]&#10;    R1 --&gt; FUSION[分数融合]&#10;    R2 --&gt; FUSION&#10;    FUSION --&gt; RERANK[重排序]&#10;    RERANK --&gt; RESULT[最终结果]&#10;    subgraph 稀疏检索&#10;        SP --&gt; BM25[BM25]&#10;        SP --&gt; SPLADE_M[SPLADE]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 稠密检索&#10;        DN --&gt; BIENC[Bi-Encoder]&#10;        DN --&gt; COLBERT[ColBERT]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    Q[用户查询] --&gt; SP[稀疏检索器]\n    Q --&gt; DN[稠密检索器]\n    SP --&gt; R1[稀疏候选集]\n    DN --&gt; R2[稠密候选集]\n    R1 --&gt; FUSION[分数融合]\n    R2 --&gt; FUSION\n    FUSION --&gt; RERANK[重排序]\n    RERANK --&gt; RESULT[最终结果]\n    subgraph 稀疏检索\n        SP --&gt; BM25[BM25]\n        SP --&gt; SPLADE_M[SPLADE]\n    end\n    subgraph 稠密检索\n        DN --&gt; BIENC[Bi-Encoder]\n        DN --&gt; COLBERT[ColBERT]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>稀疏检索</th>\n<th>稠密检索</th>\n<th>混合检索</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>精确匹配</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义匹配</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长尾查询</td>\n<td>较好</td>\n<td>依赖训练分布</td>\n<td>最优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实体/专有名词</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n<td>可能丢失</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同义词理解</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算复杂度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>索引存储</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>两倍</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"学习型稀疏检索\">学习型稀疏检索</h2><p>传统 BM25 使用固定的 TF-IDF 权重计算词项重要性，而学习型稀疏检索（Learned Sparse Retrieval）通过神经网络学习更优的词项权重，同时保持稀疏表示的可解释性和检索效率。</p>\n<p>SPLADE（SParse Lexical AnD Expansion model）是学习型稀疏检索的代表模型。它利用 BERT 的 MLM 头部为每个查询/文档生成一个词表大小的稀疏向量，其中每个维度对应词表中的一个词项，权重表示该词项的重要性。SPLADE 的关键创新在于它不仅保留了原始文档中的词项，还能通过 MLM 预测扩展出语义相关的新词项。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface SpladeOutput {&#10;  indices: number[];&#10;  values: number[];&#10;  expandedTerms: Map&lt;string, number&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface SpladeConfig {&#10;  model: string;&#10;  regLambda: number;&#10;  flopsRegLambda: number;&#10;  topK: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function spladeForward(tokenLogits: Float32Array[], attentionMask: boolean[]): SpladeOutput {&#10;  const vocabSize = tokenLogits[0].length;&#10;  const aggregated = new Float32Array(vocabSize);&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; tokenLogits.length; i++) {&#10;    if (!attentionMask[i]) continue;&#10;    for (let j = 0; j &lt; vocabSize; j++) {&#10;      const activated = Math.log(1 + Math.exp(tokenLogits[i][j]));&#10;      aggregated[j] = Math.max(aggregated[j], activated);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const indices: number[] = [];&#10;  const values: number[] = [];&#10;  for (let j = 0; j &lt; vocabSize; j++) {&#10;    if (aggregated[j] &gt; 0) {&#10;      indices.push(j);&#10;      values.push(aggregated[j]);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;  return { indices, values, expandedTerms: new Map() };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SpladeOutput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  indices</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  values</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  expandedTerms</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SpladeConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  regLambda</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  flopsRegLambda</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  topK</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> spladeForward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tokenLogits</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">attentionMask</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SpladeOutput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> vocabSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tokenLogits[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> aggregated</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(vocabSize);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tokenLogits.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">attentionMask[i]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">continue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vocabSize; j</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> activated</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tokenLogits[i][j]));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      aggregated[j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(aggregated[j], activated);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> indices</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> values</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vocabSize; j</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (aggregated[j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      indices.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(j);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      values.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(aggregated[j]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { indices, values, expandedTerms: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>DeepImpact 和 uniCOIL 是另外两种重要的学习型稀疏方法。DeepImpact 为文档中每个唯一词项学习一个标量权重，uniCOIL 则为每个 token 学习上下文感知的权重。与 SPLADE 相比，这两种方法不进行词项扩展，但计算效率更高。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分数融合策略\">分数融合策略</h2><p>混合检索的关键技术挑战是如何有效融合来自不同检索器的分数。由于稀疏和稠密检索器的分数分布差异很大（BM25 分数通常在 0-30 之间，而余弦相似度在 -1 到 1 之间），直接相加会导致某一方的贡献被淹没。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>融合方法</th>\n<th>公式/描述</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性加权</td>\n<td>α·s_sparse + (1-α)·s_dense</td>\n<td>简单直观</td>\n<td>分数已归一化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RRF</td>\n<td>Σ 1/(k + rank_i)</td>\n<td>无需分数归一化</td>\n<td>通用性最好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归一化线性</td>\n<td>α·norm(s_s) + (1-α)·norm(s_d)</td>\n<td>消除量纲差异</td>\n<td>分数分布已知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习融合</td>\n<td>MLP(features) → score</td>\n<td>自适应最优</td>\n<td>有标注数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CombMNZ</td>\n<td>norm(s) × count(s &gt; 0)</td>\n<td>奖励多系统命中</td>\n<td>多路召回</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>RRF（Reciprocal Rank Fusion）是最广泛使用的无参数融合方法，它只依赖排名位置而不依赖原始分数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface RankResult {&#10;  docId: string;&#10;  rank: number;&#10;  score: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function reciprocalRankFusion(rankings: RankResult[][], k: number = 60): Map&lt;string, number&gt; {&#10;  const fusedScores = new Map&lt;string, number&gt;();&#10;&#10;  for (const ranking of rankings) {&#10;    for (const result of ranking) {&#10;      const current = fusedScores.get(result.docId) ?? 0;&#10;      fusedScores.set(result.docId, current + 1 / (k + result.rank));&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return fusedScores;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function normalizedLinearFusion(&#10;  sparseResults: RankResult[],&#10;  denseResults: RankResult[],&#10;  alpha: number = 0.5,&#10;): Map&lt;string, number&gt; {&#10;  const sparseMax = Math.max(...sparseResults.map((r) =&gt; r.score));&#10;  const sparseMin = Math.min(...sparseResults.map((r) =&gt; r.score));&#10;  const denseMax = Math.max(...denseResults.map((r) =&gt; r.score));&#10;  const denseMin = Math.min(...denseResults.map((r) =&gt; r.score));&#10;&#10;  const fused = new Map&lt;string, number&gt;();&#10;&#10;  for (const r of sparseResults) {&#10;    const norm = (r.score - sparseMin) / (sparseMax - sparseMin + 1e-8);&#10;    fused.set(r.docId, (fused.get(r.docId) ?? 0) + alpha * norm);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  for (const r of denseResults) {&#10;    const norm = (r.score - denseMin) / (denseMax - denseMin + 1e-8);&#10;    fused.set(r.docId, (fused.get(r.docId) ?? 0) + (1 - alpha) * norm);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return fused;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RankResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  docId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292